{
  "slug": "claude-cost-tracker",
  "name": "Claude Cost Tracker",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Real-time token usage and cost analytics for Claude Code. Automatically tracks spend per developer, project, and session via a PostToolUse hook. Includes budget enforcement with daily/weekly/monthly caps and macOS notifications, multi-model pricing (Sonnet 4.5, Opus, Haiku), a slash command for instant cost reports, a conversational agent skill for natural-language cost queries, and an optional full Next.js analytics dashboard. Local-first — all data stays on your machine in SQLite unless you enable optional team sync.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, **1 command** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `cost-status` (Check current Claude Code spending, token usage, and budget status), `cost-tracking` (Track and report Claude Code token usage, spending, and budgets)\n- **Commands** (1): `cost-report` (Generate a cost report showing Claude Code token usage and spending by project, tool, and date)\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `PostToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-cost-tracker@claude-community` from `MayurBhavsar/claude-cost-tracker-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
